# Library module of reusable chrome components (change
# add-qml-component-library-q2a1, design D1). The engine's one import path
# (app/presentation/qml) makes this directory resolve as `nri.components`
# without any extra engine configuration (spec qml-shell «Модуль библиотеки
# резолвится из import-пути»).
#
# The type entries below are the contract with the following tasks: each
# component file ships under this same directory with the listed name. QML
# resolves type declarations lazily — importing the module before a
# component file exists loads without errors; only *using* a listed-but-
# missing type would fail. This is what keeps the group-1 smoke green while
# the group-2 files land.
module nri.components
ThemeButton ThemeButton.qml
ThemeField ThemeField.qml
ThemeCheckBox ThemeCheckBox.qml
ThemeComboBox ThemeComboBox.qml
TitleText TitleText.qml
HintText HintText.qml
CardPanel CardPanel.qml
RowItem RowItem.qml
